{"version":"1","id":"263b405b-96f2-46b1-ba7e-41068c375d2e","handle":"fullstackdeveloper","name":"Fullstack Developer","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--Ew7zGRJw--/f_auto/v1729193465/squads/263b405b-96f2-46b1-ba7e-41068c375d2e","description":null,"is_squad":true,"x":-8.7561,"y":9.3047,"cluster_id":2,"posts_collected":23,"newest_post_at":"2026-04-30T20:07:58.095Z","oldest_post_at":"2024-11-03T18:48:59.143Z","features":{"hype_score":0.043478,"listicle_ratio":0.0,"question_ratio":0.0,"avg_read_time":1.26087,"summary_length_avg":351.0,"title_length_avg":51.869565,"title_length_var":1169.678639,"tag_entropy":3.674493,"tag_diversity":2.26087,"top_tag_share":0.304348,"avg_upvotes":17.826087,"median_upvotes":2.0,"avg_comments":1.782609,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.10219,"zero_engagement_share":0.304348,"viral_share":0.043478,"posts_per_week":0.296471,"non_article_ratio":1.0,"author_present_share":1.0,"recency_skew":0.352941},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[8.4265,8.25],"cadence_depth":[-7.75,-8.7941],"hype_variety":[7.9118,4.9559],"title_style":[-9.5294,-2.8088]},"top_tags":[["webdev",8],["react",8],["nextjs",7],["nodejs",4],["devops",3],["tailwind-css",3],["security",2],["cicd",2]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Cursify Cursor Animation Library","Multi-Image Uploader for Next.js | Shadcn/ui | Zod","Docker deploy to vps \u2728"],"outlier":["Hi, I'm Mohi Uddin \u2014 Full-Stack Developer skilled in React, Next.js & Node.js. I build scalable SaaS/web apps. View my work: https://mohifullstack.dev. Happy to help!"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"CMlLjEl1M","title":"React vs nextjs","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/react-vs-nextjs-cmlljel1m","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T20:07:58.095Z"},{"id":"cnhTLj9gG","title":"Nextjs guide lines","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/nextjs-guide-lines-cnhtlj9gg","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-18T15:02:18.111Z"},{"id":"rmp0d0WF3","title":"Hi, I'm Mohi Uddin \u2014 Full-Stack Developer skilled in React, Next.js & Node.js. I build scalable SaaS/web apps. View my work: https://mohifullstack.dev. Happy to help!","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/hi-i-m-mohi-uddin-full-stack-developer-skilled-in-react-next-js-node-js-i-build-scalable-saas-rmp0d0wf3","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-17T10:42:32.973Z"},{"id":"wD8IlSjXU","title":"One small change reduced our API response time from~800ms to under 100ms.","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/one-small-change-reduced-our-api-response-time-from-800ms-to-under-100ms--wd8ilsjxu","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-15T23:43:35.109Z"},{"id":"ezj1ToT54","title":"Fullstack developers are quietly becoming accidental DevOps engineers. Nobody signed up for this.","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/fullstack-developers-are-quietly-becoming-accidental-devops-engineers-nobody-signed-up-for-this--ezj1tot54","summary":"Fullstack developers are increasingly absorbing DevOps responsibilities they never signed up for \u2014 fixing CI pipelines, managing Kubernetes manifests, debugging network policies \u2014 due to the gap between writing and running code. At most companies, infrastructure is too complex to be invisible but not complex enough to justify a dedicated platform team. The proposed solution is better abstraction layers that let developers express intent (deploy this API, expose it on this path) while the platform compiles that into the necessary Kubernetes resources, network policies, and observability hooks. The author draws on experience contributing to OpenChoreo, an open source CNCF project designed around this developer-first abstraction model.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--fbSJdeMf--/f_auto/v1776040426/posts/ezj1ToT54?_a=BAMAMiWQ0","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-13T00:33:46.288Z"},{"id":"AEd8XJCIW","title":"Supabase just hit 100k stars on Github","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/supabase-just-hit-100k-stars-on-github-aed8xjciw","summary":"Supabase has crossed 100k GitHub stars, placing it among the top 100 most starred repositories. The author shares why Supabase has become a default stack choice: it provides a complete backend with auth, storage, realtime, edge functions, and logs in one place, built on trusted tech like Postgres and PostgREST. The developer experience is highlighted as a key selling point, including easy local development, a clean CLI, intuitive JS client, polished Studio UI, and a generous free tier.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--uX5mLghS--/f_auto/v1775052354/posts/AEd8XJCIW?_a=BAMAMiWQ0","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-01T14:05:53.822Z"},{"id":"aJE6ga7lb","title":"Tired of Google Places API Bills? Meet OpenPOI: A High-Performance, Self-Healing POI Service","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/tired-of-google-places-api-bills-meet-openpoi-a-high-performance-self-healing-poi-service-aje6ga7lb","summary":"OpenPOI is a self-hosted alternative to Google Places API that uses OpenStreetMap data with a three-layer caching architecture (Redis, MongoDB, Overpass API). The system features a self-healing background worker that proactively fetches and caches POI data for surrounding areas using hexagonal scanning, ensuring millisecond response times for subsequent queries. It offers hybrid search capabilities, simplified opening hours parsing, and is available on RapidAPI with a free tier.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--c-xXKS-k--/f_auto/v1769777074/posts/aJE6ga7lb?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:44:32.591Z"},{"id":"A54XnaNSV","title":"Shortcut for Developers: Stop Wasting Time on YouTube API Integration!","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/shortcut-for-developers-stop-wasting-time-on-youtube-api-integration--a54xnansv","summary":"A microservice API on RapidAPI provides YouTube video scraping capabilities without requiring developers to build or maintain scraper infrastructure. The service handles proxy management, caching, and YouTube interface changes while delivering clean JSON output with best audio, video, and combined format links. Integration requires just a few lines of Node.js code using axios.","image":null,"num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-27T14:10:34.739Z"},{"id":"CutIj6NW6","title":"I made a tool to understand why stocks move the way they do","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/i-made-a-tool-to-understand-why-stocks-move-the-way-they-do-cutij6nw6","summary":"Stock Pulse is an AI-powered stock analysis platform that analyzes 10-Q filings, earnings reports, and financial data to surface insights and trends. The application is built with Next.js App Router, Firebase for authentication and database, React Query for data fetching, Zustand for state management, Recharts for visualization, and OpenAI API for AI-driven analysis. The platform is hosted on Vercel and available for free use.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--zzGGbsxM--/f_auto/v1762384129/posts/CutIj6NW6?_a=BAMAK+ZW0","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-05T23:08:48.059Z"},{"id":"msp7c500V","title":"GPT-5 curses in code","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/gpt-5-curses-in-code-msp7c500v","summary":null,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--wwcyqbyZ--/f_auto/v1754929320/posts/msp7c500V?_a=BAMClqZW0","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-11T16:22:00.652Z"}],"similar_handles":["opensourcesquad","buildwithgenai","fmasters","webdevelopement","webdev"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","xai","hamelhusain","hwchase17","skirano"],"similar":[{